# extern and resolves to NULL at link time on apps that do not link
# the ThreadX port TU (non-ThreadX apps). The conditional then folds
# at link time. See ea3ee420 + the threadx_netx_tcp_echo eth bring-up
# commit for the boot-HardFault rationale.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
